Agent mental model: adopting BDI model namely belief, desire and intention three parts to compose of the intent system of Agent;

Agent action: defining a series of Agent action rules, measurably reacting to the obtained information and adjusting the state of the Agent;

Agent method (function): the function aggregate that the Agent cures the information or completes certain task;

Agent communication mechanism and constraint.

